        "text": "radialFlux h lam U p = p.1 / L h p.2 * (2 p.2 U p - 2 p.2 (D h + lam) (average U p) - d p.2 * ∂_η (average U) p); at lam = 0 this is the paper's V₀ of (4.7), but it is defined for the slow-base field, and is not instantiated anywhere in the Outgoing*/Heated*/ExtendedHeatedOutgoing development"
